      "s": "1991-00-00",
      "e": "2011-00-00",
      "desc": "One of 10 3-Stages in Illinois to undergo Concept Unification. 3-Stage was converted into the second ever CU 1-Stage in 2011. Animatronics still in operation on their current CU 1-Stage, one of 2 sets of CEI animatronics left in CEC locations. Was in Good Condition. Chuck had full rare 'Cool Chuck' outfit, Jasper had Beach Bear Guitar, Pasqually had CU Drumfront, and Stage had Pizzacam."
